{"from": "N-000319", "type": "conflicts_with", "to": "N-000321", "provenance": "judgment", "judgment": "J-003581", "rationale": "N-000319 states quantities are normalized (time to seconds, size to bytes); N-000321 states months and years are recorded with normalized: null, meaning they are NOT normalized; both statements apply to the same temporal values (months/years are quantities) at the same time and directly contradict.", "quotes": ["They are normalized for time (to seconds), size (to bytes; KB = 1000, KiB = 1024) and count/percent (unchanged)", "Months and years are recorded with `normalized: null`"]}
{"from": "N-000319", "type": "refines", "to": "N-000318", "provenance": "judgment", "judgment": "J-003076", "rationale": "Claim A establishes that quantities are parsed from quotes into value and unit; Claim B refines this by specifying how quantities must be normalized across different types (time, size, count/percent).", "quotes": ["Quantities are parsed from the quotes by code into a value and unit", "They are normalized for time (to seconds), size (to bytes; KB = 1000, KiB = 1024) and count/percent (unchanged)"]}
